# Tailscale build options

config TAILSCALE_EXTRA_SMALL
	bool "Build extra-small binary"
	default y
	help
	  Omit more optional features and strip debug symbols to
	  reduce the binary size. Suitable for routers with small flash.

config TAILSCALE_UPX
	bool "Compress binary with UPX"
	default n
	help
	  Compress the combined binary with UPX (--lzma --best).
	  Requires the 'upx' tool installed on the build host.
	  WARNING: packers change how the binary interacts with the OS
	  and may be flagged by antivirus software. See
	  https://tailscale.com/docs/how-to/set-up-small-tailscale
